      "text": "@USCG is completing final delivery of its 18th mission-ready HC-130J, expanding long-range surveillance as Air Station Sacramento transitions to this aircraft later this year.\n\nFunded by $1.142B in the One Big Beautiful Bill Act, this investment continues a transformation that is providing state-of-the-art capabilities of our fixed-wing fleet. The HC-130J gives the Coast Guard unmatched reach, endurance, and surveillance and command-and-control capability—maximizing our ability to respond to contingencies and control, secure, and defend U.S. borders and maritime approaches.\n\nRead more here: https://t.co/VpfpPcQQIr\n\n#USCG #ForceDesign2028 #aviation #maritimesecurity \n\n@DHSgov @USCGPACAREA",
