      "text": "Icebreaking is about precision. Every operation in frozen waterways is deliberate—driven by timing, judgment, and coordination in some of the most demanding operating conditions. From the Great Lakes to the Northeast to the Mid-Atlantic, @USCG crews continuously assess ice behavior, vessel movement, and environmental factors to ensure safe, reliable access where it’s needed most. As we modernize our domestic icebreaker fleet, we continue to facilitate commerce in response to ice impacts to navigation on our waterways. \n\nRead more here: https://t.co/Qp5MeALHHO \n\n#USCG #Icebreaking #MTS #Commerce @DHSgov @USCGGreatLakes @USCGLANTAREA @USCGNortheast \n\nClip credits in Instagram",
      "text_resolved": "Icebreaking is about precision. Every operation in frozen waterways is deliberate—driven by timing, judgment, and coordination in some of the most demanding operating conditions. From the Great Lakes to the Northeast to the Mid-Atlantic, @USCG crews continuously assess ice behavior, vessel movement, and environmental factors to ensure safe, reliable access where it’s needed most. As we modernize our domestic icebreaker fleet, we continue to facilitate commerce in response to ice impacts to navigation on our waterways. \n\nRead more here: https://www.dhs.gov/news/2026/02/04/coast-guard-responds-severe-winter-conditions-icebreaking-operations-eastern-united \n\n#USCG #Icebreaking #MTS #Commerce @DHSgov @USCGGreatLakes @USCGLANTAREA @USCGNortheast \n\nClip credits in Instagram",
