      "text": "Super Bowl weekend in San Francisco.\n\nAs fans arrive and events fill the Bay Area, the U.S. Coast Guard is bringing our specialized capabilities, including tactical teams and explosive detection K9s, to secure San Francisco Bay and the surrounding waterfront.\n\nWe’re focused on securing ports and waterways so everyone else can focus on the game.\n\n#USCG #SuperBowl #SBLX #MaritimeSecurity @DHSgov @USCGPACAREA @USCGSouthwest",
