      "text": "Unforgiving environments. Specialized capability. Relentless devotion to duty.\n\nDuring Operation Deep Freeze, U.S. Coast Guard Cutter Polar Star employed specialized diving capability and an unmanned underwater vehicle to support French partners in recovering a lost diver near Dumont d’Urville Station in Antarctica. In the face of crisis or tragedy, the Coast Guard brings every resource at our disposal to complete the mission.\n\nSupporting allies where few can operate.\n\n#uscg @DHSgov @USCGPACAREA",
